    "text": "SpaceX's Ship 42 returned to the arms of the Mechazilla Chopsticks, concluding Starship Flight 15 and marking the first Ship catch in the Starship program!\n\nHere is the official NSF replay video showing all the best angles from the team.  They caught the ship!!\n\nyoutu.be/fAGdYMJDqGk",
